I have a PC164 (no suffix) running 4.11 and I want to put one of my collection
of DEC KZPAC (DAC960) raid controllers into it and upgrade to 5.4.

Will a KZPAC boot on a PC164?

The FreeBSD hardware notes are obscure on this point: they seem to say that
genuine DAC 960 will NOT boot but can be used for other disks but there is a
footnote suggesting that a KZPAC will boot on some systems. 

Anybody know for sure?  

I administer various DS20's and AlphaServer 4100's who are happy to boot Tru64
off a KZPAC but I don't know about a PC164. 

